WEBVTT

00:00:08.270 --> 00:00:11.767
Do you coach group trainings? Connect RunSynergy under Settings → Sources.

00:00:11.817 --> 00:00:17.626
Paste the calendar link from RunSynergy here (My details → Calendar link).

00:00:17.676 --> 00:00:21.406
Today shows the group schedule as a proposal for your Training geven session.

00:00:21.456 --> 00:00:26.443
You see which day and time it is for, and what your plan already has that day.

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:32.626
Warm-up and cool-down until you press lap, the core on time to blow the whistle, you in Z1.

00:00:32.676 --> 00:00:37.763
It is also under Waiting for you → Your decision, with the same day; and on Planning.

00:00:37.813 --> 00:00:45.315
Adopt puts it in your plan and on your watch; it counts as planned.
